{"type": "user", "message": {"role": "user", "content": [{"tool_use_id": "toolu_01Kya9UCGmounm4FFuJHbv4w", "type": "tool_result", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "{\"excerpt_removed\": true, \"references\": [{\"url\": \"https://zh.wikisource.org/zh-hant/%E5%84%80%E7%A6%AE%E5%95%86_(%E5%9B%9B%E5%BA%AB%E5%85%A8%E6%9B%B8%E6%9C%AC)/%E5%8D%B71\"}, {\"url\": \"https://commons.ln.edu.hk/sw_master/1929\"}, {\"url\": \"https://scholars.ln.edu.hk/en/publications/an-interpretation-of-the-phrase-shi-dongbi-and-related-ceremonies/\"}, {\"url\": \"https://zh.wikisource.org/wiki/%E6%AC%BD%E5%AE%9A%E5%8F%A4%E4%BB%8A%E5%9C%96%E6%9B%B8%E9%9B%86%E6%88%90/%E7%B6%93%E6%BF%9F%E5%BD%99%E7%B7%A8/%E7%A6%AE%E5%84%80%E5%85%B8/%E7%AC%AC018%E5%8D%B7\"}, {\"url\": \"https://scholars.ln.edu.hk/en/publications/%E8%AB%B8%E4%BE%AF%E5%86%A0%E7%A6%AE%E4%B9%8B%E7%A5%BC%E4%BA%AB%E6%AD%A3%E7%95%B6%E5%A3%AB%E5%86%A0%E7%A6%AE%E4%B9%8B%E9%86%B4%E6%88%96%E9%86%AE%E8%80%83%E8%BE%A8/\"}, {\"url\": \"https://cup.cuhk.edu.hk/chinesepress/journal/ICS59/ICS59_1-28.pdf\"}, {\"url\": \"https://chinesenotes.com/analysis/yili/yili001_analysis.html\"}, {\"url\": \"https://www.cuhk.edu.hk/ics/journal/articles/v59p001.pdf\"}, {\"url\": \"https://zh.wikisource.org/zh-hant/%E7%BE%A3%E7%B6%93%E8%A3%9C%E7%BE%A9_(%E5%9B%9B%E5%BA%AB%E5%85%A8%E6%9B%B8%E6%9C%AC)/%E5%8D%B73\"}]}"}]}]}, "parent_tool_use_id": null, "timestamp": "2026-10-20T23:49:12.933Z", "tool_use_result": {"query": "賓揖將冠者 贊者 進櫛 爲之櫛 合紒 관례 찬자 머리 빗", "results": [{"tool_use_id": "srvtoolu_01TpzmLBZiUz2ZbKjZbwq4Zk", "content": [{"title": "zh.wikisource.org", "url": "https://zh.wikisource.org/zh-hant/%E5%84%80%E7%A6%AE%E5%95%86_(%E5%9B%9B%E5%BA%AB%E5%85%A8%E6%9B%B8%E6%9C%AC)/%E5%8D%B71"}, {"title": "\"《儀禮 ‧ 士冠禮》冠者取脯適東壁見母解\" by Tzu Pin HSU", "url": "https://commons.ln.edu.hk/sw_master/1929"}, {"title": "an interpretation of the phrase shi dongbi and related ceremonies", "url": "https://scholars.ln.edu.hk/en/publications/an-interpretation-of-the-phrase-shi-dongbi-and-related-ceremonies/"}, {"title": "zh.wikisource.org", "url": "https://zh.wikisource.org/wiki/%E6%AC%BD%E5%AE%9A%E5%8F%A4%E4%BB%8A%E5%9C%96%E6%9B%B8%E9%9B%86%E6%88%90/%E7%B6%93%E6%BF%9F%E5%BD%99%E7%B7%A8/%E7%A6%AE%E5%84%80%E5%85%B8/%E7%AC%AC018%E5%8D%B7"}, {"title": "scholars.ln.edu.hk", "url": "https://scholars.ln.edu.hk/en/publications/%E8%AB%B8%E4%BE%AF%E5%86%A0%E7%A6%AE%E4%B9%8B%E7%A5%BC%E4%BA%AB%E6%AD%A3%E7%95%B6%E5%A3%AB%E5%86%A0%E7%A6%AE%E4%B9%8B%E9%86%B4%E6%88%96%E9%86%AE%E8%80%83%E8%BE%A8/"}, {"title": "ICS59 1 28", "url": "https://cup.cuhk.edu.hk/chinesepress/journal/ICS59/ICS59_1-28.pdf"}, {"title": "yili001 analysis", "url": "https://chinesenotes.com/analysis/yili/yili001_analysis.html"}, {"title": "cuhk.edu.hk", "url": "https://www.cuhk.edu.hk/ics/journal/articles/v59p001.pdf"}, {"title": "zh.wikisource.org", "url": "https://zh.wikisource.org/zh-hant/%E7%BE%A3%E7%B6%93%E8%A3%9C%E7%BE%A9_(%E5%9B%9B%E5%BA%AB%E5%85%A8%E6%9B%B8%E6%9C%AC)/%E5%8D%B73"}]}, "I didn't find the passage you asked about. None of the results contain 進櫛, 爲之櫛, or 合紒, and nothing came up on the Korean 찬자 terms. The results do cover the surrounding capping (冠禮) ritual in *儀禮·士冠禮*.\n\n- **Mother visit after the capping:** One paper quotes the 士冠禮 text for the step where the newly capped youth takes dried meat, goes to the east wall, and sees his mother, who receives it. 根據《儀禮 ‧ 士冠禮》的敘述,冠者見母的儀節是緊接第三次加冠完畢和賓禮冠者之後舉行的. The same paper says scholars have long debated what \"適東壁\" (going to the east wall) means.\n- **Helpers (贊者) in the ritual:** A Ming-era commentary notes that 冠者 refers to the youth and the people assisting in the rite, including the 贊禮 (ritual assistants). 陳注冠者,賓與贊禮之人也。 This is the closest result to your 贊者 question, but it does not mention combing.\n- **Three capping stages:** A Wikisource text of the 禮記 commentary explains the three caps: the first is the black cloth cap, the second the leather cap, and the third the 爵弁. It says 三加者,始加緇布冠,次皮弁,次爵弁。\n\nTo find the hair-combing passage, search for the 士冠禮 text directly, for example \"士冠禮 進櫛 贊者\" on a classical-text site such as ctext.org, or search for 관례 절차 찬자 빗질 in Korean sources."], "durationSeconds": 6.792161833999999, "searchCount": 1}, "tool_result_meta": [{"id": "toolu_01Kya9UCGmounm4FFuJHbv4w", "permission_decision": {"decision": "accept", "source": "hook", "reason_type": "hook"}}]}
